and insufficient risk-adjusted margin of safety warrants holding off on order submission.   RESULT: Argued the bear case against the SPY iron condor setup due to short strike proximity (short put delta ~0.26 vs target 0.16), potential trend day vulnerability, and thin risk-adjusted credit, successfully withholding order execution per instructions.' trace=/Users/robertgrzesik/Library/Caches/lumibot/1.0/agent_runtime/traces/bear/d9358e9e1e7965c2f28c669631ef5613bac6888e7e8c69c02a58a78bf744a8fe-20260923042713454735.json
